data: {"answer": "這裡是「湖畔別墅套房・客人隱私」房間，主要展示智慧電視、語音控制與房卡等裝置。退房時必須重設每台裝置，以確保下一位客人不會看到前一位的資料。此處可見客房智慧控制系統、電子門鎖系統，以及退房隱私重設、資料最小化與保存期限等防護措施。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "客房智慧控制與電視是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the Smart Room Controls & TV do?", "zh": "客房智慧控制與電視是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 8.44, "total_s": 8.45}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "villa_in", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "villa_in"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 5.4}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "villa_in", "label": "Room", "en": "Lake Villa Suite", "zh": "湖畔別墅套房"}, {"key": "room_controls", "label": "System", "en": "Smart Room Controls & TV", "zh": "客房智慧控制與電視"}, {"key": "door_locks", "label": "System", "en": "Electronic Door Locks", "zh": "電子門鎖系統"}, {"key": "checkout_reset", "label": "Control", "en": "Checkout Privacy Reset", "zh": "退房隱私重設"}, {"key": "retention_deletion", "label": "Control", "en": "Data Minimization & Retention Schedule", "zh": "資料最小化與保存期限"}], "edges": [{"a": "checkout_reset", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "villa_in"}, {"a": "door_locks", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "villa_in"}, {"a": "room_controls", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "villa_in"}, {"a": "retention_deletion", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "villa_in"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：湖畔別墅套房・客人隱私\n代表的資訊主題：套房裡的智慧電視、語音控制和房卡，看得出一間客房存了多少客人資料。\n重點：退房時把每台裝置重設，下一位客人才不會看到前一位的資料。\n這裡的系統：客房智慧控制與電視、電子門鎖系統\n看得到的防護措施：退房隱私重設、資料最小化與保存期限\n相關的處理流程：退房時重設智慧客房\n這個房間藏著 1 個資安漏洞（要玩家自己找，不要說出來）\n可以走到：泳池・資料湖", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 8.43, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 581, "prompt_s": 2.25, "gen_tokens": 77, "gen_s": 6.16, "tok_per_s": 12.5, "first_token_s": 2.27}}, "state": {}}

